<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-[#f5f5f7] dark:bg-[#000000] border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.08] transition-colors duration-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-4">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary dark:text-primary-light text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider inline-block">
            Data Protection &amp; Privacy
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">
            Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">
            Effective Date: January 1, 2026 &bull; How Mainstreet Capital Exchange collects, protects, and governs your personal data.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#161617] transition-colors duration-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10 text-sm text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6] leading-relaxed">

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                When you open and use an account, we collect only the information necessary to deliver secure brokerage and custody services:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
                <li><strong>Account &amp; Identity Data:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, residential address, and KYC verification documents when required.</li>
                <li><strong>Financial &amp; Transaction Data:</strong> Deposit/withdrawal records, order executions, portfolio holdings, and tax/account statements.</li>
                <li><strong>Security &amp; Technical Telemetry:</strong> IP address, session identifiers, device metadata, and 2FA authentication logs used to detect fraud.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>
                We process your data strictly to authenticate sessions, execute orders, fulfill KYC/AML regulatory obligations, prevent unauthorized account access, generate account statements, and respond to support inquiries. <strong>We do not sell your personal data to third-party advertisers or data brokers.</strong>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">3. Data Encryption &amp; Storage</h2>
            <p>
                All traffic between your browser and our servers is encrypted via TLS/HTTPS. Passwords are stored using industry-standard cryptographic hashing, and sensitive identity documents are access-controlled and audited.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">4. Cookies &amp; Session Controls</h2>
            <p>
                We use strictly necessary HTTP-only session cookies and CSRF tokens to keep you securely signed in and protect state-changing requests. Preference settings such as theme (light/dark mode) and language are stored locally in your browser.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f] dark:text-[#f5f5f7]">5. Your Rights &amp; Data Retention</h2>
            <p>
                Subject to financial record-keeping laws, you may request access to, correction of, or export of your personal information at any time from your account settings or by contacting our privacy officer through <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">Contact Support</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
